# love.image

+ love.image.isCompressed
	* Determina whether a file can be loaded as CompressedData. 	Added since 0.9.0 	
+ love.image.newCompressedData
	* Create a new CompressedImageData object from a compressed image file. 	Added since 0.9.0 	
+ love.image.newEncodedImageData
	* Encodes ImageData. Removed in 0.8.0
+ love.image.newImageData
	* Creates a new ImageData object.

Tipos de datos relacionados 

CompressedImageData 	Compressed image data designed to stay compressed in RAM and on the GPU. 	Added since 0.9.0 	
ImageData 	Raw (decoded) image data. 	

## Enumerables

CompressedImageFormat 	Compressed image data formats. 	Added since 0.9.0 	
ImageFormat 	Encoded image formats.